Algorithm Graph_Coloring

1. Start

2. Define graph and colors
   Colors = {Red, Green, Blue, Yellow}
   Result = empty

3. Function Safe(node, color)
      For each neighbor of node
          If neighbor has the same color
              Return False
      Return True

4. Function Color_Graph(nodes)
      If nodes is empty
          Return True

      node = first node in nodes

      For each color in Colors
          If Safe(node, color)
              Assign color to node

              If Color_Graph(remaining nodes)
                  Return True

              Remove color from node

      Return False

5. If Color_Graph(all nodes) = True
      Print each node and its color
   Else
      Print "No solution"

6. Stop
